{
  "id": "icewind-dale-vagabond-rpg",
  "title": "Icewind Dale: Rime of the Frostmaiden (Vagabond RPG)",
  "description": "<p>Icewind Dale: Rime of the Frostmaiden converted for the <strong>vagabond-rpg</strong> system.</p><ul><li><strong>436 actors</strong>: every creature type on the adventure roster, plus the named NPCs filed by chapter.</li><li><strong>Magic items</strong> built to Vagabond's Relic conventions.</li><li><strong>11 encounter maps</strong>, 10 roll tables and 3 reference journals.</li></ul><p>Import <strong>Icewind Dale (Complete)</strong> from the Adventures compendium to bring everything into a world with its folders. Contains no published adventure text.</p>",
